262 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\042 The SD monogram is designed as one unified structure\054 symbolizing connected engineering solutions\054 teamwork\054 and seamless execution across projects\056\n\042 The sharp angular cuts represent precision\054 technical expertise\054 and industrial craftsmanship\056 It gives the identity a strong engineering personality\056\n\042 The central vertical elements resemble structural pillars\054 steel beams\054 or architectural supports\056 This subtly connects the brand to infrastructure\054 fabrication\054 and construction\056\n\042 The curved outer D creates a protective framework around the logo\054 representing stability\054 reliability\054 and long term strength\056\n\042 The forward leaning S shape creates movement and momentum\054 symbolizing growth\054 innovation\054 and progress\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 263 0 R
     /Pg 246 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

